Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Every question can become the starting point of new knowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep exploring, and your Section Map grows with you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.50,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask once. Notipala does more than organize an answer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Open Evidence to verify each claim
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Connect the sources, concepts, and decisions behind it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring your own material by uploading a file
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.40,0:00:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Preserve its structure and build a connected map in the background
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask a follow-up without starting over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the previous context visible as the same map grows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In Memory Mode, choose the sections to focus on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask with the context you selected
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Selected nodes light up immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:01:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,See the exact reasoning path Notipala used
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Select any node to inspect its Section note
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose an edge to understand the relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Every connection stays explainable and traceable
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to the map and keep exploring
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.50,0:01:17.00,Brand,,0,0,0,,Notipala
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:19.00,Brand,,0,0,0,,Turn every question into knowledge that compounds
